  "description" : "First entry carrying a selection - the source's own quirk, reproduced rather than repaired. :124 tests CDEMO-CT02-TRN-SELECTED against SPACES AND LOW-VALUES and :126-127 moves it into CARDNINI, the CARD NUMBER field, because map COTRN2A has no transaction-identifier field to move it into; the slot most likely came from COTRN01C, where the same commarea field really does key a transaction. :128 then performs PROCESS-ENTER-KEY on the strength of it. VALIDATE-INPUT-KEY-FIELDS finds ACTIDINI at low-values from :122, so the EVALUATE at :195 falls to the card arm at :210: the value is numeric, FUNCTION NUMVAL at :218 converts it, :220-221 normalises it back over the screen field, and READ-CCXREF-FILE at :222 finds the row on the CCXREF base cluster - the second of this dataset's two access paths - so :223 moves XREF-ACCT-ID into ACTIDINI. VALIDATE-INPUT-DATA-FIELDS then rejects on its first arm, :251-256, because TTYPCDI is low-values. The cursor is reported on ACTIDINL rather than TTYPCDL: both length items hold -1, and a 3270 places the cursor in the first such field in map declaration order.",
